# Check every text file out with LF on every platform. The windows-latest CI
# runner's global core.autocrlf=true otherwise rewrites the checkout to CRLF,
# and the tests that pin shipped wording (AGENTS.md's directive, the factory
# SKILL.md frontmatter, README.md's command list, the review-replay fixtures)
# match against `\n` — they read the WORDING, and the encoding must not drift
# per OS (inc-spor-windows-ci-main-failing).
* text=auto eol=lf
# The Windows shims are checked out byte-for-byte as committed.
*.cmd -text
*.bat -text
